            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "string+theory+FAQ#HowDoesStringTheoryMakePredictions"} string theory FAQ - Does string theory make predictions?
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/string+theory+FAQ#WhatDoesItMeanToSayStringTheoryHasALandscapeOfSolutions"} string theory FAQ – What does it mean to say that string theory has a “landscape of solutions”?
          %h2#references References
          %h3#ftheory_flux_compactification F-theory flux compactification
          %p
            Surveys of the general story of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux+compactification"} flux compactification
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"} F-theory
            includes
          %ul
            %li#Denef08
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frederik+Denef"}> Frederik Denef
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Les Houches Lectures on Constructing String Vacua
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/String+theory+and+the+real+world"} String theory and the real world
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0803.1194"}> arXiv:0803.1194
              )
          %h3#landscape_of_type_ii_vacua Landscape of Type II vacua
          %p
            Scan of the moduli space of semi-realistic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+string+theory"} type IIB
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+model"} intersecting D-brane model
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactifications"} KK-compactifications
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifolds"} orbifolds
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gepner+models"} Gepner models
            is in
          %ul
            %li#DijkstraHuiszoonSchellekens04a
              %p
                T.P.T. Dijkstra, L. R. Huiszoon,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bert+Schellekens"} Bert Schellekens
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Chiral Supersymmetric Standard Model Spectra from Orientifolds of Gepner Models
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0403196"} arXiv:hep-th/0403196
            %li#DijkstraHuiszoonSchellekens04b
              %p
                T.P.T. Dijkstra, L. R. Huiszoon,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bert+Schellekens"} Bert Schellekens
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersymmetric Standard Model Spectra from RCFT orientifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0411129"} arXiv:hep-th/0411129
          %p
            and scan
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+string+theory"} type IIB
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+D-brane+model"} intersecting D-brane model
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactifications"} KK-compactifications
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/toroidal+orbifolds"} toroidal orbifolds
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Blumenhagen"}> Ralph Blumenhagen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Florian+Gmeiner"} Florian Gmeiner
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriele+Honecker"} Gabriele Honecker
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dieter+L%C3%BCst"} Dieter Lüst
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Timo+Weigand"} Timo Weigand
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Statistics of Supersymmetric D-brane Models
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0411173"} arXiv:hep-th/0411173
            %li#GBHLW05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Florian+Gmeiner"}> Florian Gmeiner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Blumenhagen"} Ralph Blumenhagen
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriele+Honecker"} Gabriele Honecker
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dieter+L%C3%BCst"} Dieter Lüst
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Timo+Weigand"} Timo Weigand
                = succeed "," do
                  %em One in a Billion: MSSM-like D-Brane Statistics
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0510170"} arXiv:hep-th/0510170
          %h3#landscape_of_heterotic_vacua Landscape of heterotic vacua
          %p
            The origin of all
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+phenomenology"} string phenomenology
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/top-down+model+building"} top-down approach
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string"} heterotic string
            due to (
            %a{:href => "heterotic+string+theory#CHSW85"}> Candelas-Horowitz-Strominger-Witten 85
            ).
          %p
            A brief review of motivations for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/GUT"} GUT
            models in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Witten02
