              %a{:href => "http://www.desy.de/susy02/"} SUSY 2002
              at DESY, Hamburg (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/0207124"}> arXiv:hep-ph/0207124
              )
          %p
            The following articles establish the existences of exact realization of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+group"} gauge group
            and
            = succeed "-content" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matter"} matter
